(PUBLIC WORKS DEPARTMENT — Tender SE/ELE/22/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.1 Design and construction of RCC shall be in accordance with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(4.2 Grade of concrete for all structural members shall be M 30.) Tj T*
(4.3 Clear cover to main reinforcement shall be 45mm for all members.) Tj T*
(4.4 Maximum free water cement ratio shall be 0.45.) Tj T*
(4.5 Cement content shall not be less than 320 Kg/cum of concrete.) Tj T*
(4.6 OPC 43 grade cement as per IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(4.7 Aggregates shall comply with the requirements of IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(4.8 High strength deformed bars of grade Fe 500D as per IS 1786:2008 shall be used.) Tj T*
(4.9 Mix design shall be carried out in accordance with IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(4.10 Concrete shall be kept continuously moist for at least 10 days.) Tj T*
(4.11 Compaction shall be done by immersion vibrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(5.1 The internal wiring installation shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(5.2 Earthing arrangement of the installation shall be TN-S system.) Tj T*
(5.3 All wiring shall be drawn through heavy gauge PVC conduits recessed in walls.) Tj T*
(5.4 Building wires shall be 450/750 V grade PVC insulated multistrand copper conductor) Tj T*
(as per IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(5.5 Minimum conductor size shall be 1.5 sq.mm for lighting points and 4 sq.mm for power) Tj T*
(points.) Tj T*
(5.6 MCBs shall be C-curve, as per IS/IEC 60898-1, with rated short circuit capacity of) Tj T*
(10 k.A..) Tj T*
(5.7 Final circuit MCBs shall be rated between 6 A and 32 A.) Tj T*
(5.8 Socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs conforming to IS 12640) Tj T*
(\(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(5.9 The earthing system shall be designed and installed as per IS 3043:1987.) Tj T*
(5.10 Main distribution board shall be earthed through two separate pipe earth) Tj T*
(electrodes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
